ciliation differences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Corporate Tax Case"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a hypothetical company:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting profit"},{"text":"Tax adjustments"},{"text":"Allowable expenses"},{"text":"Disallowances"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Taxable profit"},{"text":"Tax liability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Tax Compliance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Power BI to track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Filing deadlines"},{"text":"Tax payments"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"Open notices"},{"text":"Compliance status"},{"text":"Exceptions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Tax Research Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a current tax issue and produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Applicable law"},{"text":"Relevant rules"},{"text":"Facts"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Possible interpretation"},{"text":"Compliance implications"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Tax"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income Tax"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Corporate Tax"},{"text":"International Tax"},{"text":"Transfer Pricing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Qualifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the intended career:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CA — strongest route for professional tax, audit and advisory careers in India"},{"text":"ACCA — useful for accounting and international finance/tax environments"},{"text":"CMA — useful for management accounting and corporate finance"},{"text":"CFA — generally more relevant to investments than taxation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a dedicated tax career, CA or specialised tax experience can be substantially more valuable than accumulating unrelated certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Tax software"},{"text":"RPA fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry Level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax Intern"},{"text":"Tax Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Tax Analyst"},{"text":"Tax Associate"},{"text":"Tax Compliance Associate"},{"text":"GST Associate"},{"text":"GST Analyst"},{"text":"Tax Operations Associate"},{"text":"TDS Analyst"},{"text":"Tax Research Associate"},{"text":"Tax Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experienced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Tax Analyst"},{"text":"Senior Tax Associate"},{"text":"Corporate Tax Analyst"},{"text":"GST Specialist"},{"text":"Tax Compliance Specialist"},{"text":"Tax Consultant"},{"text":"Tax Advisory Associate"},{"text":"International Tax Analyst"},{"text":"Transfer Pricing Analyst"},{"text":"Tax Research Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Senior"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax Manager"},{"text":"Senior Tax Consultant"},{"text":"Tax Advisory Manager"},{"text":"Corporate Tax Manager"},{"text":"GST Manager"},{"text":"Transfer Pricing Manager"},{"text":"International Tax Manager"},{"text":"Tax Technology Manager"},{"text":"Tax Director"},{"text":"Head of Tax"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers Usually Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Three financial statements"},{"text":"Profit vs taxable income"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Provisions"},{"text":"Working capital"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tax"},{"type":"p","text":"Questions may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Taxable income"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"Input Tax Credit"},{"text":"Corporate taxation"},{"text":"Tax deductions"},{"text":"Compliance requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Task"},{"type":"p","text":"You may receive a company's financial information and be asked to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review the accounting data."},{"text":"Identify tax-relevant transactions."},{"text":"Separate accounting and tax adjustments."},{"text":"Calculate taxable income."},{"text":"Identify applicable taxes."},{"text":"Reconcile tax records."},{"text":"Prepare a compliance summary."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"note","label":"Scenario","text":"GST Reconciliation Difference"},{"type":"p","text":"A company has:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase records showing ₹50 lakh"},{"text":"GST records showing ₹47 lakh"},{"text":"A difference of ₹3 lakh"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Tax Analyst should not simply adjust the difference."},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst should:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compare purchase invoices."},{"text":"Check invoice dates."},{"text":"Verify GSTIN details."},{"text":"Match supplier records."},{"text":"Check credit/debit notes."},{"text":"Review input-tax-credit eligibility."},{"text":"Identify timing differences."},{"text":"Check duplicate or missing invoices."},{"text":"Document the reconciliation."},{"text":"Escalate unresolved differences."}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the core skill of a tax analyst: accurate reconciliation + regulatory interpretation + documentation."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income-tax administration"},{"text":"GST administration"},{"text":"Government accounting"},{"text":"Public-sector finance"},{"text":"Tax compliance"},{"text":"Revenue departments"},{"text":"Financial regulatory organisations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com graduates may also pursue relevant competitive examinations and professional routes. Exact eligibility depends on the recruitment notification and post."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not mandatory for an entry-level Tax Analyst."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"M.Com Taxation"},{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"MBA Taxation"},{"text":"M.Sc Finan